{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--verb-reduplication-expresses-action-plurality","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Verbal reduplication functions to express plurality of action or repetition.","ja":"動詞の重複は動作の複数性または反復を表す機能を持つ。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0024-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0025-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--verb-reduplication-expresses-lexical-aspect","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Verbal reduplication in Ainu expresses lexical aspect rather than the grammatical category of number.","ja":"アイヌ語の動詞畳語は数のカテゴリーではなく語彙的アスペクトを表す手段である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2022@handbook-epub/l0110-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contrasts","claim":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--verb-reduplication-expresses-action-plurality","differs_in":"level-of-analysis","note":"Nakagawa analyzes reduplication as expressing lexical aspect rather than number or action plurality."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--full-reduplication-of-a-verb-or-adjective-stem","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Full reduplication of a verb or adjective stem expresses iterative aspect.","ja":"動詞（または形容詞）の語幹を反復するものは、反復態を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0185-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-the-verbal-root-expresses-iterative-aspect","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of the verbal root expresses iterative aspect.","ja":"動詞の語根を反復するものは、反復態を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0186-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-the-portion-of-the-root-following","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of the portion of the root following the initial consonant expresses continuative aspect.","ja":"語根の頭音以外の部分を反復するものは、持続態を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0187-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-the-final-syllable-of-the-verb","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of the final syllable of the verb stem expresses continuative aspect.","ja":"語幹の最後の音節を反復するものは、持続態を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0187-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-adverbs-or-particles-indicates-emphasis","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of adverbs (or particles) indicates emphasis.","ja":"副詞（又は助詞）の反復は、強調を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0188-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-verb-stems-expresses-repetition-of-an","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of verb stems expresses repetition of an action or a high degree of a quality.","ja":"動詞語幹の反復形は、動作の反復や程度の高いことを表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0098-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--verbal-reduplication-in-ainu-includes-root-reduplication-partial","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Verbal reduplication in Ainu includes root reduplication, partial stem reduplication, and full stem reduplication.","ja":"アイヌ語には動詞語根、語幹の一部、語幹全体が重複されるものがある。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0149-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--verb-root-reduplication-indicates-repetition-of-action-for","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Verb root reduplication indicates repetition of action for transitive verbs, and repetition of change of state or high degree of state for intransitive verbs.","ja":"動詞語根の重複は、他動詞では「動作の反復」、自動詞では「状態変化の反復」「状態の程度が大きいこと」を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0149-02","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--partial-stem-reduplication-of-verbs-expresses-the-continuation","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Partial stem reduplication of verbs expresses the continuation of the result after an action is performed.","ja":"動詞語幹の一部の重複は「動作が行われた後の結果の持続」を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0149-03","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--full-stem-reduplication-of-verbs-expresses-repetition-of","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Full stem reduplication of verbs expresses repetition of action/change of state, continuation of action, or high degree of state.","ja":"動詞語幹全体の重複は「動作・状態変化の反復」「動作の継続」「状態の程度が大きいこと」を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0149-04","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-the-root-or-part-of-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of the root or part of the stem is in principle restricted to V/-pa type verbs, whereas full stem reduplication is found on various verbs.","ja":"語根ないし語幹の一部の重複は原則的に V/-pa 型の動詞に限られるが、語幹全体の重複は V/-pa 型には限られず、いろいろな動詞に見られる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-pa"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0150-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--in-ainu-word-formation-roots-may-undergo-reduplication","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"In Ainu word formation, roots may undergo reduplication, and vowel reduplication occurs commonly in derivational morphology.","ja":"アイヌ語の語形成において、語根が重複されることがあり、語派生において母音の重複（反復）が一般的に見られる。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:okuda2022@handbook-epub/l0069-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-the-verb-is-mostly-used-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of the verb is mostly used to indicate repetition or duration of an action or phenomenon.","ja":"動詞の重複は、動作や現象の反復または継続を示すために主として用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":[],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0144-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--verbs-formed-by-reduplicating-a-root-element-express","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Verbs formed by reduplicating a root element express the repetition of an action whose range or degree is small and affects only a part.","ja":"語根要素の重複によって形成された動詞は、範囲や程度が小さく一部分にしか及ばない行為の反復を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["moymoye","yasyaske"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0264-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--when-an-entire-word-is-reduplicated-rather-than","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"When an entire word is reduplicated rather than just the root element, it seems to express complete repetition of the action.","ja":"語根部分だけでなく語全体を重複する場合は、完全な動作の反復を表すようである。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yaskeyaske"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0264-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-plays-an-important-role-in-verb-word","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication plays an important role in verb word formation, whereas nouns formed by reduplication (such as ramram 'scales' and taktak 'lump') are not very common.","ja":"重複によって作られた名詞の例はさほど多くないが（ramram「鱗」、taktak「塊」など）、動詞の語形成の手段として重複は重要な役割を果たす。"},"type":"frequency","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ramram","taktak"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0294-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--reduplication-of-the-verbal-root-e-g-yas","revision":1,"topic":"topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topics":["topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction","topic:phon/reduplication-phonology-rule-interaction--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reduplication of the verbal root (e.g. yas-yas-ke) is associated with an action occurring irregularly in various places, complete reduplication of the word (e.g. yaske-yaske) is associated with an action occurring to a full degree, and partial reduplication of the root (e.g. sik-mak-ak-a) is associated with the continuation of the resulting state.","ja":"動詞において語根の重複（yas-yas-ke など）は行為があちこちで不規則に行われること、語の完全な重複（yaske-yaske など）は行為が完全な程度に行われること、語根の部分重複（sik-mak-ak-a など）は行為の結果状態の持続と関連があるようである。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yas-yas-ke","yaske-yaske","sik-mak-ak-a"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0294-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
